    <article>
      <section id="overview" class="lt">
        <h2>Overview</h2>
        <p>For the CosIQ Landing Page, I focused on creating a mobile-first design that would resonate with Gen Z users. The main goal was to introduce CosIQ, build trust, educate users, and guide them towards making a purchase through CashKaro for cashback benefits. Throughout the design process, I made decisions to ensure that the landing page was engaging, simple, and aligned with Gen Z’s preferences. Here’s a breakdown of my design process and reasoning behind each decision</p>
      </section>

      <section id="goals" class="lt">
        <p class="eyebrow">01</p>
        <h2>Understanding the Goals</h2>
        <p>Before jumping into design, I understood the primary goals of the landing page:</p>
        <ul class="pts">
          <li><strong>Build trust and familiarity:</strong> The user should immediately feel like CosIQ is a brand they can trust.</li>
          <li><strong>Educate users:</strong> Not all users will be familiar with CosIQ’s products, so educating them on the benefits and product USPs was crucial.</li>
          <li><strong>Encourage conversion:</strong> A clear and easy journey from awareness to conversion with CashKaro’s added value.</li>
        </ul>
        <p>I kept these objectives in mind throughout the design to make sure the user would be compelled to explore, learn, and eventually make a purchase.</p>
      </section>

      <section id="mobile" class="lt">
        <p class="eyebrow">02</p>
        <h2>Mobile-First Design</h2>
        <p>Since mobile-first was a key requirement, I ensured that the design would be optimized for smaller screens:</p>
        <ul class="pts">
          <li><strong>Thumb-friendly layout:</strong> I considered how users hold their phones, and ensured that CTAs and clickable elements are within the easy reach of their thumbs. This reduces friction and improves the user experience.</li>
          <li><strong>Simple, scroll-friendly layout:</strong> To accommodate Gen Z’s fast-scrolling behavior, I used modular design, breaking the page into digestible sections with smooth scrolling and clear cards.</li>
        </ul>
        <p>This approach ensures that users can effortlessly explore the page without feeling overwhelmed.</p>
      </section>

      <section id="colour" class="lt">
        <p class="eyebrow">03</p>
        <h2>Color Palette and Branding</h2>
        <p>For CosIQ, I chose a vibrant color palette featuring shades of pink, and white, which not only aligns with the brand’s aesthetic but also grabs attention without being overwhelming. I specifically used:</p>
        <ul class="pts">
          <li>Pink and orange tones to keep the landing page energetic and fresh. These colors also resonate well with Gen Z, who prefer bright, vibrant visuals.</li>
          <li>White space for cleanliness and simplicity, ensuring the page doesn’t feel cluttered or overwhelming.</li>
        </ul>
        <p>The use of these colors also aligns with the brand’s identity of being clean, clinical, and approachable.</p>
      </section>

      <section id="copy" class="lt">
        <p class="eyebrow">04</p>
        <h2>Copy and Tone</h2>
        <p>I chose a concise and friendly tone to match the brand’s personality. Since the landing page was targeting Gen Z, I made sure the language was fun, engaging, and aligned with their vernacular. For example:</p>
        <ul class="pts">
          <li>“Ready to Boost Your Skin IQ?” instead of more formal phrases, making the brand sound more approachable.</li>
          <li>Replaced long descriptions with short, impactful copy that conveys the message quickly, such as “Get skincare that’s clear, clinical, and cashback-friendly.”</li>
        </ul>
        <p>The CTA buttons were also made bold and action-oriented, with phrases like “Start Customizing” and “Activate Flat ₹300 Cashback” to encourage immediate action.</p>
        <figure class="cut"><img src="img/04-ready-to-boost.webp" width="800" height="1574" alt="The closing block of the CosIQ page: Ready to Boost Your Skin IQ? above the CashKaro and CosIQ logos" loading="lazy"></figure>
      </section>

      <section id="trust" class="lt">
        <p class="eyebrow">05</p>
        <h2>Trust-Building Elements</h2>
        <p>To establish credibility and build trust with new users, I focused on incorporating real customer reviews and testimonials prominently:</p>
        <ul class="pts">
          <li>“Real Reviews from Real Users” was a section where users could see authentic experiences with the products.</li>
          <li>Displaying user reviews provided a social proof effect, helping new visitors feel comfortable with making a purchase.</li>
        </ul>
        <p>The aim was to show that CosIQ isn’t just a skincare brand, but a trusted and genuine solution recommended by real users.</p>
        <figure class="cut"><img src="img/05-reviews.webp" width="800" height="2247" alt="Real Reviews from Real Users: a swipeable row of review cards and a Shark Tank India card with a quote from Vineeta Singh" loading="lazy"></figure>
      </section>

      <section id="education" class="lt">
        <p class="eyebrow">06</p>
        <h2>Educational Content</h2>
        <p>Since many users may not be familiar with the benefits of CosIQ products, I made sure to educate users clearly but concisely:</p>
        <ul class="pts">
          <li><strong>“Why Buy via CashKaro”:</strong> This section clearly explained the value of using CashKaro to earn cashback, helping users understand how they could save money by purchasing through the app.</li>
          <li><strong>“CosIQ Bestsellers”:</strong> Highlighted top products with clear benefits, allowing users to make informed choices.</li>
        </ul>
        <p>The educational content was kept engaging and snackable, making sure users could quickly digest it and decide whether they wanted to buy the products.</p>
        <div class="cuts">
          <figure class="cut"><img src="img/06a-why-cashkaro.webp" width="800" height="1210" alt="Why Buy via CashKaro: three numbered steps to shop smart and an Activate Flat 8% Cashback button" loading="lazy"></figure>
          <figure class="cut"><img src="img/06b-bestsellers.webp" width="800" height="1725" alt="CosIQ Bestsellers: a product carousel card for the Niacinamide Vitamin B3 20% serum at ₹588 with a Shop Now button" loading="lazy"></figure>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section id="ctas" class="lt">
        <p class="eyebrow">07</p>
        <h2>Clear and Compelling CTAs</h2>
        <p>The CTAs were designed to be simple, bold, and action-oriented, leading users down a clear path:</p>
        <ul class="pts">
          <li>Buttons like “Start Customizing” and “Shop Now” were placed strategically throughout the page to encourage users to take action at every point of their journey.</li>
          <li>The use of repetition of CTAs (e.g., at the end of each section) makes sure users don’t have to scroll far to act on their interest.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section id="urgency" class="lt">
        <p class="eyebrow">08</p>
        <h2>Limited-Time Offer for Urgency</h2>
        <p>A sense of urgency was created with a banner saying, “Skintelligent Shopping Ends Soon!”. This motivated users to act quickly and created FOMO (Fear of Missing Out), which is a strong motivator for Gen Z consumers.</p>
        <figure class="cut"><img src="img/08-urgency.webp" width="800" height="1100" alt="The urgency banner with three reasons to buy and a Limited Time Offer ribbon across a CosIQ exfoliant" loading="lazy"></figure>
      </section>

      <section id="testing" class="lt">
        <p class="eyebrow">09</p>
        <h2>Informal Testing</h2>
        <p>After creating the initial design, I did some informal testing by showing the landing page to people who had never heard of CosIQ. Their feedback confirmed that:</p>
        <ul class="pts">
          <li>The brand message was clear, and they understood the product’s value instantly.</li>
          <li>The call-to-action buttons were easy to notice and tap on.</li>
          <li>They felt confident about purchasing through CashKaro due to the easy-to-understand cashback process.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section id="design" class="wide">
        <h2>Landing Page Design</h2>
        <div class="iph lpd noisl"><div class="sc" tabindex="0" aria-label="Scroll the screen"><img src="img/10-landing-page.webp" width="720" height="10761" alt="The full CosIQ landing page on a phone, from the Where Skin Meets Science hero through Build Your Own Routine, Bestsellers, Real Reviews, Why Buy via CashKaro, the urgency banner and Ready to Boost Your Skin IQ?" loading="lazy"></div></div>
        <div class="strip" aria-hidden="true"><div><img style="transform:translateY(-0.0000%)" loading="lazy" aria-hidden="true" src="img/10-landing-page.webp" width="720" height="10761" alt=""></div><div><img style="transform:translateY(-33.3333%)" loading="lazy" aria-hidden="true" src="img/10-landing-page.webp" width="720" height="10761" alt=""></div><div><img style="transform:translateY(-66.6667%)" loading="lazy" aria-hidden="true" src="img/10-landing-page.webp" width="720" height="10761" alt=""></div></div>
      </section>

      <section id="conclusion" class="lt">
        <h2>Conclusion</h2>
        <p>This landing page is designed to educate, engage, and convert users into customers for CosIQ. By simplifying the experience, incorporating trust-building elements, and ensuring the design was aligned with Gen Z’s preferences, the landing page effectively drives the user journey. The use of vibrant colors, interactive sections, and engaging CTAs all help to create an optimized, mobile-first experience that not only informs users but also convinces them to take the next step in their shopping journey with CashKaro.</p>
      </section>
    </article>
